2. Compute Max Abs Error, RMS Error, and argmax agreement for all four positions.
3. If verified, mark independent multi-token correctness VERIFIED.
4. Implement MVP-0 autoregressive generation and sampling.
5. Only then begin ARM64/NEON optimization and benchmark gates.

